      "value": "100% down for this. I enjoy playing VRChat with a friend of mine, but they don't feel comfortable using voice chat to speak, and having to take the time to tab out to use a 3rd party program kills the experience for them. Hoping that this feature would bring in both him and other M/KB players who feel the same way.",
